Make a button change text:<pre class="cai-code"><code>&lt;button id=&quot;btn&quot;&gt;Click me&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;msg&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;script&gt;
  document.getElementById(&quot;btn&quot;).addEventListener(&quot;click&quot;, function () {
    document.getElementById(&quot;msg&quot;).textContent = &quot;You clicked!&quot;;
  });
&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>

Loops repeat steps. Arrays hold lists:<pre class="cai-code"><code>const fruits = [&quot;mango&quot;, &quot;banana&quot;, &quot;orange&quot;];
for (let i = 0; i &lt; fruits.length; i++) {
  console.log(fruits[i]);
}</code></pre>

Use if/else to make decisions:<pre class="cai-code"><code>let mark = 65;
if (mark &gt;= 50) {
  console.log(&quot;Pass&quot;);
} else {
  console.log(&quot;Try again&quot;);
}</code></pre>Compare with <code>==</code> (or <code>===</code>), <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>.

A simple form:<pre class="cai-code"><code>&lt;form&gt;
  &lt;label&gt;Name: &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; name=&quot;name&quot;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot;&gt;Send&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;</code></pre>

Centre things with flexbox:<pre class="cai-code"><code>.box {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}</code></pre>Use <code>flex-direction: column</code> for a vertical layout. Add <code>flex-wrap: wrap</code> so items wrap on small phone screens.

To make a page work on phones, add <code>&lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"&gt;</code> and use a media query:<pre class="cai-code"><code>@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .menu { display: none; }
}</code></pre>
